  "description": "Two cabs, 24 players, 12 rounds played in parallel pairs with disjoint tappers. Each round's drafters and gamblers are everyone not tapping it, and nobody drafts both games of a slot. Everyone taps 5 times, drafts once and gambles 6 times.",
